1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,660
Like someone can be a completely nice guy, that doesn't mean that you all have great chemistry.

2
00:00:04,900 --> 00:00:08,100
Someone can be a good guy and it doesn't mean that you all have chemistry.

3
00:00:08,340 --> 00:00:12,440
None of these things should determine whether or not you have to give somebody a chance.

4
00:00:12,540 --> 00:00:15,360
At the end of the day, do y'all mesh? Do y'all click?

5
00:00:15,540 --> 00:00:19,940
And do you have healing in your own space to even be able to take in a good guy?

6
00:00:21,120 --> 00:00:22,600
Huh? Because that's the other part.

7
00:00:22,680 --> 00:00:25,500
When I see the nice guys finish last rhetoric, I say to myself,

8
00:00:25,600 --> 00:00:26,860
who are the nice guys hollering at?

9
00:00:26,860 --> 00:00:31,160
I don't know about y'all, but I feel like I be seeing nice guys always trying to holler at the bad guys.

10
00:00:31,400 --> 00:00:33,040
The nice guys are trying to get the city girls.

11
00:00:33,460 --> 00:00:36,060
City girls don't want you. They can't even accept you.

12
00:00:36,180 --> 00:00:40,300
They've got too much going on in their intentions, in their trauma, etc.

13
00:00:40,380 --> 00:00:43,600
to even pay attention to you, let alone the good guys.

